      "blocks": {
        "slide_M3hzU9": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "stars_count": 5,
            "heading": "Nicole",
            "text": "“Absolutely beautiful flowers—fresh, elegant, and perfectly arranged. The setup was smooth and stress-free. Our guests kept complimenting the decor all night. I’ll definitely book again for future events!”",
            "author_date": ""
          }
        },
        "slide_ynaftB": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "stars_count": 5,
            "heading": "Erin C.",
            "text": "“The attention to detail was incredible. From bouquets to table styling, everything felt thoughtfully done and aesthetically stunning. The team understood our theme perfectly and brought it to life beyond expectations.”",
            "author_date": ""
          }
        },
        "slide_c9RpMB": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "stars_count": 5,
            "heading": "Sonia",
            "text": "“Our party florals were breathtaking—vibrant colors, premium quality blooms, and delivered right on time. It transformed the whole venue into something magical. Highly recommended for any event!”",
            "author_date": ""
          }
        },
        "slide_9qaWjh": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "stars_count": 5,
            "heading": "Dee Aras",
            "text": "Wow! Such lovely flowers.I bought this today day and was delivered within a hour or two. My sister sent me a photo that showed a very similar bouquet to what I purchased and exclaimed “ it is the prettiest bouquet she has ever received!”Thank you Growing Wild for your incredible work to make her birthday a special one",
            "author_date": ""
          }
        },
        "slide_QVTcNa": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "stars_count": 5,
            "heading": "Gina Rembert",
            "text": "Growing Wild is a charming flower shop in the heart of Manhattan Beach. It has been there for over 30 years, so it has stood the test of time. They have a beautiful selection of fresh flowers as well as succulents, plants, shells and a variety of unique gifts. The owner and staff are friendly and professional. I highly recommend this shop!",
            "author_date": ""
          }
        },
        "slide_FBHTYJ": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "stars_count": 5,
            "heading": "Jennifer Vinson",
            "text": "The arrangement was gorgeous! The most amazing flowers I've ever sent! It was perfect for my sisters birthday!! Thank you so much!!",
            "author_date": ""
          }
        },
        "slide_thjKx7": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "stars_count": 5,
            "heading": "teresa mccoy",
            "text": "Growing Wild is an absolute gem of a flower shop. Every arrangement is beautifully crafted with care and creativity — you can truly see the love that goes into every detail. Nora, the owner, is such a wonderful lady! She’s kind, thoughtful, and always goes above and beyond to make sure her customers are happy. Whether it’s for a special occasion or just to brighten someone’s day, Growing Wild never disappoints. Highly recommend this lovely local business! 🌸🌿",
            "author_date": ""
          }
        }
      },
